[38;2;124;124;124mThis is a question from gauge theory / differential geometry, specifically about[0m[38;2;124;124;124mthe topology of the moduli space of connections modulo gauge transformations.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet me set up the framework:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- Let $M$ be a compact four-manifold (smooth, oriented, typically).[0m
