[38;2;124;124;124m$A$).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe key issue: Is the quotient $\mathcal{B} = \mathcal{A}/\mathcal{G}$ [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mparacompact in the quotient Sobolev topology?[0m

