[38;2;124;124;124m\dim(M)/2 = 2$, i.e., $k \geq 2$), the gauge transformations are continuous, and[0m[38;2;124;124;124m$\mathcal{G}$ is a Hilbert Lie group acting smoothly on $\mathcal{A}$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mNow, the question is whether the quotient $\mathcal{A}/\mathcal{G}$ is [0m
